                    },
                    "name": "STD-03 Medicine Comparison State",
                    "documentation": "Object: MedicineComparison\nPurpose: Model the lifecycle of a medicine comparison as it moves through review and verification.\nRelated Requirements: FR-21-FR-27, BR-01-BR-04.\nTraceability: AD-03 Medicine Matching & Pharmacist Verification; SD-03.\nNote: a pharmacist review comment is optional review information, not a lifecycle state - no 'Comment Added' state is modelled.\nNote: a Potential Match (STD-02) and a Pharmacist-Verified Comparison are distinct concepts and are not collapsed.",
