                {
                    "_type": "UMLStateMachine",
                    "_id": "STD05",
                    "_parent": {
                        "$ref": "MEDACCESS-MODEL"
                    },
                    "name": "STD-05 Refill Reminder State",
                    "documentation": "Object: RefillReminder\nPurpose: Model the lifecycle of a user's medicine refill reminder.\nRelated Requirements: FR-32, FR-33, FR-34.\nTraceability: AD-07 Refill Reminders; SD-07.\nRecurrence is modelled as configuration on the existing lifecycle (Scheduled -> Triggered -> reschedule -> Scheduled), not as a separate state machine. If recurrence is not implemented in the MVP it remains an optional extension.\nBoundary: a refill reminder is a convenience function - no dosage modification, treatment advice, prescription change, diagnosis or autonomous medical recommendation is modelled.",
